Author: mubarak96-max <mubarakmmm5@gmail.com>
Date:   Fri Sep 18 19:06:18 2026 +0400

    feat: implement durable job orchestration with approval-driven pipeline
    
    - Added a new jobs module for managing durable jobs, including engine, providers, costs, and pipeline orchestration.
    - Implemented approval-driven pipeline logic to handle planning steps and visual generation.
    - Introduced types and error handling for job approvals and repairs.
    - Created fake providers for LLM and image generation to facilitate testing without live dependencies.
    - Established transactional leases for job documents in Firestore to prevent concurrent lease issues.
    - Developed smoke tests to validate job engine functionality and orchestration logic.
    - Updated schemas to support new job structures and states.
    - Added adapters for legacy job handling during migration to the new job document structure.

